rite the event before verification completes. The exported API does not prevent this ordering. Chain each `verifyRecorded()` call behind the previous call's completion, so that a call resolves only after every event recorded before it has been verified.","id":"6534d5679717678dbd24af51ec0a70c82f95e1767bb8146a47243579876c510f","intervals":[[88,89]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/backfillPreparedRepo.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Serialize `verifyRecorded()` so an overlapping call cannot resolve before the first call finishes verifying."}],"head":"353b2b20f91e94fce3e299bcdf96b37500ebf0d2","head_tree":"2a6378f38614c8b16a7d30447cf71e2ddc2985f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"913e170a75e5389a96dd17b337da88c3ae8ff008","intervals":[[1,88]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/admitWiring.ts"},{"blob":"b74fc3ca33b5d64c24f5abe3b4f16ce2606cac5a","intervals":[[1,114]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/atomic.ts"},{"blob":"c9a1faffb5ab6c0ed6bafb2ec8ce16d432bd287a","intervals":[[1,100]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/backfillPreparedRepo.ts"},{"blob":"466a2f5b1c1e39671ec42979428ede68f411b036","intervals":[[1,41]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/identityProcess.ts"},{"blob":"622122bf418a05cc3fdb27303882d15a2ed74ca0","intervals":[[1,111]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/repairUnit.ts"},{"blob":"f6a85c9fa944cc4ad5bde7617b4a89e4dadc47a6","intervals":[[1,76]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/slotDeadlineSource.ts"},{"blob":"587e5b94c9ce63fd797785ca1aa6072d54d9a084","intervals":[[1,67]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/slotPhaseSeams.ts"},{"blob":"7212d1b21c810c11d3eca7686dc5c9bbfe287891","intervals":[[1,78]],"path":"src/adapters/crq/tickEnrollmentPhaseSource.ts"}],"job_id":"5cc19a5064be72d8fb6d4001bf28e0b6c9447aa8bccda40558eedf130eca0fbb:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"913e170a75e5389a96dd17b337da88c3ae8ff008","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/adapters/crq/admitWiring.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method